      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我现在知道了：我要在主人前面，要他看见我。他看见我的时候，会和我玩。",
      "traditional": "我現在知道了：我要在主人前面，要他看見我。他看見我的時候，會和我玩。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiàn zài zhī dào le wǒ yào zài zhǔ rén qián miàn yào tā kàn jiàn wǒ tā kàn jiàn wǒ de shí hou huì hé wǒ wán",
      "english": "Now I knew: I had to be in front of my owner and make him look at me. When he looked at me, he would play with me."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "茶茶说：“世界是我们的！”",
      "traditional": "茶茶說：“世界是我們的！”",
      "pinyin": "chá chá shuō shì jiè shì wǒ men de",
      "english": "Chacha said, “The world belongs to us!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“什么？世界是我们的？”我看看茶茶。",
      "traditional": "“什麼？世界是我們的？”我看看茶茶。",
      "pinyin": "shén me shì jiè shì wǒ men de wǒ kàn kan chá chá",
      "english": "“What? The world belongs to us?” I looked at Chacha. "
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“是的。人们要听我们的，人要听手机的。”茶茶说。",
      "traditional": "“是的。人們要聽我們的，人要聽手機的。”茶茶說。",
      "pinyin": "shì de rén men yào tīng wǒ men de rén yào tīng shǒu jī de chá chá shuō",
      "english": "“Yes. People must listen to us; people have to listen to phones,” said Chacha."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "茶茶在说什么？我有点儿不懂。没关系，我不想懂。",
      "traditional": "茶茶在說什麼？我有點兒不懂。沒關係，我不想懂。",
      "pinyin": "chá chá zài shuō shén me wǒ yǒu diǎn'r bù dǒng méi guān xi wǒ bù xiǎng dǒng",
      "english": "What was Chacha talking about? I didn’t understand at all. Never mind, I didn’t want to understand."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "因为我现在可以和大星在一起了。我可以身体热，我可以看电影。",
      "traditional": "因為我現在可以和大星在一起了。我可以身體熱，我可以看電影。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wǒ xiàn zài kě yǐ hé dà xīng zài yì qǐ le wǒ kě yǐ shēn tǐ rè wǒ kě yǐ kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": "Because now I could be together with Daxing. I could get hot, and I could watch movies."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "大星听见我了，看见我了，我会回他的手里。我们在一起，我们能一起玩。",
      "traditional": "大星聽見我了，看見我了，我會回他的手裡。我們在一起，我們能一起玩。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng tīng jiàn wǒ le kàn jiàn wǒ le wǒ huì huí tā de shǒu lǐ wǒ men zài yì qǐ wǒ men néng yì qǐ wán",
      "english": "Daxing heard me, looked at me, and I would return to his hands. We were together, and we could play together."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    }
