    "sentence_translations": [
      "The World Belongs to Us",
      "",
      "Now I knew: I had to be in front of my owner and make him look at me. When he looked at me, he would play with me.",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “The world belongs to us!”",
      "",
      "“What? The world belongs to us?” I looked at Chacha. ",
      "",
      "“Yes. People must listen to us; people have to listen to phones,” said Chacha.",
      "",
      "What was Chacha talking about? I didn’t understand at all. Never mind, I didn’t want to understand.",
      "Because now I could be together with Daxing. I could get hot, and I could watch movies.",
      "Daxing heard me, looked at me, and I would return to his hands. We were together, and we could play together.",
      ""
    ]
  }
